==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|euphony|ic|pos2=suffix forming adjectives with the sense ‘of or pertaining to’}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=65032|date=September 2019|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=adj}}</ref>

